{"id":"vod_sn_37189","vodId":"37189","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"愿此刻永恒","name_cn":"愿此刻永恒","date":"2003-01-01","year":"2003","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/576600b99fa1bb3bf1de152aca7aecac.jpg"},"summary":"鸣海孝之（谷山纪章 配音）、平慎二（青木城 配音）和速濑水月（石桥朋子 配音）是学生时代的好友，毕业在即，三人亦即将奔向不同的未来。某日，鸣海孝之结识了名叫凉宫遥（栗林美奈实 配音）的少女，在速濑水月的牵线搭桥下，鸣海孝之和凉宫遥走到了一起。　　其实，水月一直暗暗的喜欢着孝之，在生日当天，她找到了正准备和凉宫遥约会的孝之，希望他能够送自己一枚戒指作为礼物。然而，当孝之告别水月来到约会地点时，等待着他的却是凉宫遥因车祸而陷入昏迷的噩耗。三年之后，凉宫遥从昏迷中苏醒了，可是她的记忆依旧停留在三年前出事的那一天，殊不知此时的孝之和水月早已经走到了一起。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:49:48","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kujH3eJKRW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2ASiQAKtPf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rh6wHbqvSF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ddNMxnbvhd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1X21wJDMmA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zUvmd1j8Va1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9nrcCTa89d1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6n82DJbuU51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/B7hD5ULkRr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HGY9vDCW3J1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JULRXBHhjx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0CSkGtKTcb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bAs04YaWWt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mddpKehtJa1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10